# Catalog content changes

Before adding or remapping controls, templates, or fixture families:

1. Score the control with `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-15-pac-applicability-rubric.md` (In / Stretch / Out).
2. Follow `docs/superpowers/recipes/adding-a-control.md`.
3. Set required `pacApplicability` (`in` | `stretch`) and `pacRationale` on every control. Never commit Out controls to `controls.json`.

Unrelated UI or bug-fix PRs are out of scope for this rule.
